<div class="pharma-company">
    <div class="pharma-company-story">
        <h3>Reliable sourcing supports reliable manufacturing</h3>
        <p>Tiryaq is a pharmaceutical manufacturing company. Our procurement team helps production teams get the materials and services they need by defining purchasing requirements, reviewing supplier documentation, and coordinating deliveries with qualified suppliers.</p>
        <p>For us, a good supplier relationship starts with clear expectations. We share what the business needs, give suppliers a way to demonstrate how they can meet those needs, and document how purchasing decisions are made.</p>
    </div>
    <dl class="pharma-company-priorities">
        <div>
            <dt>Quality at the point of purchase</dt>
            <dd>We review supplier documents and compare offers with the specifications for each purchase.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
            <dt>Continuity for production teams</dt>
            <dd>We consider delivery timelines and a supplier’s ability to meet the needs of the business.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
            <dt>Clear communication with suppliers</dt>
            <dd>We set out tender requirements and deadlines so suppliers know what to submit and when.</dd>
        </div>
    </dl>
</div>
